# Pursuit Of Clan Ambition (Q503), the last leg: the leader of a level 4 clan kills the Grave Guard
# that calls the Grave Keymaster (a spawned NPC the Boot tests play), takes the sixth Imperial key from the Keymaster and opens a coffer
# for the Scepter of Judgment, and hands it to Sir Gustav for the Seal of Aspiration and 250000 SP.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q503_pursuit_of_clan_ambition_finish.golden
character Leader 40
clan 4
quest Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition <cond>=10 killed=4 <state>=STARTED
